{
  "category": "Classy Cat Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Behind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A PERSIAN’s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. It is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.",
      "version": "pearl"
